<title>SINGAPORE: Electronic Resources gets upgraded.</title>
<headline>Electronic Resources gets upgraded.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electronic Resources Ltd said on Wednesday it will soon be upgraded to the mainboard of Stock Exchange of Singapore.</p>
<p>The company said it recieved in-principle approval to transfer from the second board to the mainboard on April 4.</p>
<p>The transfer will take effect on April 21, 1997, it said.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
